{"evt":"edge_added","from":"note:note-mqq01krivx2","to":"codex/code-ast-extractor","kind":"context","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-23T02:02:25.041Z","weight":1}
{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqq01krivx2","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Native onboarder multi language extractor: pluggable interface, babel for JS TS, tree sitter WASM for the rest","summary":"Multi-language answer for the native code onboarder (the Phase-1 @babel/parser extractor is JS/TS-only by design). Make extraction PLUGGABLE: a single interface extractFile(path, source) -> {symbols, edges} with per-language backends behind a registry keyed by file extension. JS/TS/JSX -> @babel/parser (done — richest JS/TS fidelity incl TS types + the CJS/ESM export handling, zero native deps). All OTHER languages -> tree-sitter, specifically web-tree-sitter (WASM grammars) NOT native tree-sitter — WASM needs no node-gyp/per-platform native build, so it is portable across Windows/mac/Linux and dodges the native-binary pain we hit with worktree node_modules; vendor the .wasm grammar files + write one symbol/call/import query (.scm) per language. The Phase-1 output shape ({name,kind,file,start/end line,signature,exported} + calls/imports edges) is already language-agnostic, so the Phase-2 code_node layer consumes any backend's output uniformly — adding a language NEVER touches the daemon, only adds a grammar + query. KEY FRAMING: tree-sitter is exactly the engine cmm + graphify use under the hood (158 langs) — so 'our way' for breadth is NOT reinventing parsing, it reuses the proven parser and owns only the index+retrieval layer, which is where the benchmark proved our KB beats cmm. Hybrid (keep @babel for JS/TS + tree-sitter for the rest) vs all-tree-sitter is a fidelity-vs-uniformity tradeoff the pluggable interface DEFERS — start hybrid, can migrate later. OPEN FORK (user decision): language BREADTH — JS/TS only (own stack, @babel suffices) / a common handful (Python, Go, Rust, Java, C/C++ via tree-sitter) / broad arbitrary (toward cmm's 158). Marginal cost per language is one extraction query (~50 lines), not new engine work — breadth is a dial, not a rebuild.","category":"project","tags":["native-onboarder","ast","tree-sitter","multi-language","architecture","pluggable"],"created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-23T02:02:24.990Z","vec":[-0.08408229053020477,-0.03264502063393593,0.012131343595683575,0.045726582407951355,0.015632763504981995,-0.06117787957191467,-0.037745241075754166,0.07282357662916183,-0.022251468151807785,0.02581261843442917,-0.04745081067085266,-0.05339222773909569,0.034920189529657364,-0.05218856409192085,0.02916840650141239,-0.0058038849383592606,0.01307279709726572,0.0705287754535675,-0.029528990387916565,-0.12080620229244232,0.026543693616986275,0.009013998322188854,-0.0377252921462059,-0.017325719818472862,0.036811280995607376,0.0248014647513628,-0.054887983947992325,-0.007977400906383991,0.01999925822019577,-0.03599821403622627,-0.012223976664245129,0.08400722593069077,-0.03825332224369049,0.08873682469129562,-0.05064350739121437,0.0851798728108406,-0.004918182268738747,-0.11279881000518799,-0.052765216678380966,-0.06577416509389877,-0.022276006639003754,0.1520521491765976,-0.030145782977342606,-0.043444640934467316,0.03938508778810501,-0.04802792891860008,-0.08151257783174515,-0.014025584794580936,-0.08912035822868347,-0.022071391344070435,-0.04937398061156273,-0.0256528090685606,-0.03123549558222294,-0.01725185662508011,0.07566343247890472,-0.005561938509345055,0.006969319190829992,0.0013362978352233768,0.005471309646964073,0.025581669062376022,-0.041198812425136566,-0.0006361661362461746,0.009615430608391762,-0.01447325013577938,0.024099314585328102,0.03386786952614784,0.005859434604644775,0.03993864357471466,0.04353354498744011,-0.00352117489092052,-0.07940337806940079,-0.013761410489678383,-0.07744616270065308,0.05348202586174011,-0.0624554418027401,0.0226267222315073,0.05261111631989479,0.07013364881277084,0.0005850988673046231,-0.046515051275491714,-0.023242350667715073,0.04512734338641167,-0.006159375887364149,-0.007349856663495302,0.00730948057025671,-0.00423332117497921,-0.0175020601600408